        "caveats": [
          "Program, version and procedure numbers have no proto3 counterpart; gRPC routes by service and method name. Keep them in the service's documentation for the cut-over.",
          "A string<N> or opaque<N> bound is not enforced by proto3; validate it in the handler.",
          "A fixed-length array ([N]) becomes repeated with no length guarantee.",
          "XDR optional-data (*) becomes proto3 optional; a recursive list via a pointer becomes a repeated field."
